  "questionText": "Consider the following relations $P(X,Y,Z)$, $Q(X,Y,T)$ and $R(Y,V)$.<br><br><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; margin: 12px 0;\"><div style=\"overflow-x: auto;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ffffff; text-align: center; font-size: 13px;\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">P</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">X</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">Y</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">Z</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">X1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Z1</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">X1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Z2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">X2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Z2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">X2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y4</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Z4</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"overflow-x: auto;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ffffff; text-align: center; font-size: 13px;\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">Q</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">X</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">Y</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">T</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">X2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">X1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">5</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">X1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">6</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">X3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">1</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"overflow-x: auto;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ffffff; text-align: center; font-size: 13px;\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">R</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">Y</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold;\">V</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">V1</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">V2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">V3</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">Y2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 6px 12px;\">V2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><br>How many tuples will be returned by the following relational algebra query?<br><br><div style=\"overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; padding: 8px 0; text-align: center;\">$$\\prod\\nolimits_{X}(\\sigma_{(P.Y=R.Y \\land R.V=V2)}(P \\times R)) - \\prod\\nolimits_{X}(\\sigma_{(Q.Y=R.Y \\land Q.T>2)}(Q \\times R))$$</div>",
